#: docwordcompletion.cpp:480
msgid ""
"_: Translators: This is the first part of two strings wich will comprise the "
"sentence 'Show completions when a word is at least N characters'. The first "
"part is on the right side of the N, which is represented by a spinbox widget, "
"followed by the second part: 'characters long'. Characters is a ingeger number "
"between and including 1 and 30. Feel free to leave the second part of the "
"sentence blank if it suits your language better. \n"
"Show completions &when a word is at least"
msgstr ""

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:486
msgid ""
"_: This is the second part of two strings that will comprise teh sentence 'Show "
"completions when a word is at least N characters'\n"
"characters long."
msgstr ""

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:489
msgid ""
"Enable the automatic completion list popup as default. The popup can be "
"disabled on a view basis from the 'Tools' menu."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die opspring van die voltooiïng lys as standaard. Die opspring kan "
"vanaf die 'Nutsprogramme' kieslys gedeaktiveer word op 'n vertoon basis."

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:492
msgid ""
"Define the length a word should have before the completion list is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Definieer hoe lank 'n woord moet wees voordat die voltooiïng lys vertoon word."

